    "detailed_description": "Friendly Fox \u2013 F.F.S. brings you a startling new tale of magic, mystery, and murder in Living Legends: The Blue Chamber!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlex has come to Bird\u2019s Nest Castle to visit his sister but arrives to find her missing and her husband under attack by a painting come to life, and that\u2019s just the beginning! Help Alex solve the castle\u2019s puzzles and challenges as he races to learn the truth behind the castle\u2019s dark past and rumors of a curse that plagues it to this day! You\u2019ll need all your searching skills and puzzling prowess to unravel the mystery and save Alex\u2019s sister in this fantastic new Hidden-Object Puzzle Adventure game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a special Collector's Edition release full of exclusive extras you won\u2019t find in the standard version.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Collector\u2019s Edition includes:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022\tHelp the famous artist, Katrina, break the terrifying curse cast by magical paints on her son, Christian!<br />\r\n\u2022\tCollect morphing objects and enchanted birds in every scene! Play the bonus puzzle in Extras! <br />\r\n\u2022\tEnjoy wallpapers, screensavers, and music tracks from the game! Save one of each for later! <br />\r\n\u2022\tNever get lost with the strategy guide!",
